<section class="content-section"><div class="wrap page-split"><div><p class="section-kicker">ABOUT THE PRODUCT</p><h2 style="font-family:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700">VYQDA Retail for real-world workflows.</h2><p>VYQDA Retail is intended for retail-oriented billing and operational use cases. Before selecting a setup, it is important to confirm product catalogue needs, stock workflows, hardware, reporting and any existing systems.</p><p>Before adopting any operational software, confirm feature availability, data handling, device compatibility and rollout requirements for your organisation.</p></div><div><ol class="page-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Billing workflows</strong><p>Review the billing process and requirements at the point of sale.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Inventory-related tasks</strong><p>Identify stock records, movement and reporting workflows that matter.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Store operations</strong><p>Consider user roles, device setup and day-to-day store needs.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Operational fit</strong><p>Confirm required capabilities and integrations before making rollout decisions.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></section>
