<section class="content-section product-detail-section content-section--tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading-page"><p class="section-kicker">BUYER'S GUIDE</p><h2>Retail billing software should fit the store workflow</h2><p>Retail billing and inventory software needs to match the realities of a store: product variants, stock movement, returns, price changes, staff permissions and reporting. Build a checklist for your store and verify support for each required workflow before implementation.</p></div><div class="page-grid"><article class="page-card"><span class="page-card__number">01</span><h3>Product catalogue and stock</h3><p>Confirm how items, variants, opening stock, stock adjustments and low-stock checks are managed in the product.</p></article>
